=== 3. REPAIR ===
The gate no longer greps for the animation's name. It extracts handleAcceptProposal (and
the helpers it calls) out of the comment-stripped code view and RUNS them in node's vm
inside a recording Proxy sandbox, twice: isApiLive() true and false. It records every
request, every open of the progress dialog, every step advance, and whether that advance
happened inside a setTimeout callback. Finding: in LIVE mode the modal must not be
advanced by a clock, and must not open at all unless an escrow-or-contract request was
issued. Before believing any of that it runs the SAME assertion table against F-0239
frozen into the gate (F-0273's device) and exits 1 'this gate cannot fail' if it passes.
A helper the handler calls that the run could not see inside is reported BLIND; the gate
pulls it into the fragment and re-runs, and reports unavailable rather than green if it
still cannot see.

